<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo adds 500 mln marks to June 2002 bond. [CORRECTED 10:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo adds 500 mln marks to June 2002 bond. [CORRECTED 10:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was</p>
<p>announced by joint lead managers Dresdner Kleinwort Benson,</p>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank, Commerzbank and Trinkaus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK FRANKFURT AG</p>
<p> AMT   *500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    17.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.92     PAY DATE   *02.APR.97</p>
<p>(Lead manager corrects ISS PRICE from 98.67)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES     *FUNGIBLE WITH 1.0 BLN DEM LAUNCHED 10.JAN AT 98.90.</p>
<p>		PAYMENT PLUS 75 DAYS ACCRUED. SHORT FIRST COUPON.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
